TIPS
--------------------------------------------------
  - Keep fields private and access them through getters and setters.
  - Use this.name = name; in constructors.
  - A method that returns a value should not print it. Print in main().
  - Always check for null before using an element of an object array.
  - Before running the code, dry-run it by hand with small inputs.
  - Test edge cases: empty array, one element, full array, invalid input.